<title>BELGIUM: Lamfalussy says hopes for lira ERM deal.</title>
<headline>Lamfalussy says hopes for lira ERM deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Monetary Institute head Alexandre Lamfalussy said he hoped an agreement on the lira's return to the Exchange Rate Mechanism can be reached at a top level meeting in Brussels on Sunday.  </p>
<p>&quot;I hope there will be an agreement, that's all I can say,&quot; Lamfalussy said as he entered the building where EU finance ministers were due to renew efforts to establish terms of the lira's re-entry into the system.</p>
<p>On Saturday, EU monetary committee failed to agree the terms over differences on the entry exchange rate, officials said. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
